---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "September 18, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Partner Program Terms | Sonura"
  description="The terms of the Sonura Partner Program. Covers commission rates, conversion tracking, payout schedule, and promotion rules."
  keywords="sonura partner program, sonura affiliate terms, sonura commission, sonura affiliate payouts"
  canonical="https://sonurastudio.com/partner-terms/"
  ogTitle="Partner Program Terms | Sonura"
  ogDescription="Commission rates, payouts, and promotion rules for the Sonura Partner Program."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="legal-hero-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">01 / Legal</p>
      <h1 class="legal-headline">Partner Program Terms</h1>
      <p class="legal-subhead">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="legal-content-inner">
      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>This section explains how the Sonura Partner Program works. By joining, you agree to refer new customers to Sonura in exchange for commission on their subscription payments, under the terms below.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Eligibility</h2>
        <p>You must be 18 or older and have an active Sonura account to apply. We may decline or remove any partner at our discretion, including for fraudulent, misleading, or spammy promotion.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="commissions">
        <h2>3. How Commissions Work</h2>

        <h3>3.1 Commission rate</h3>
        <p>Partners earn between 30% and 50% commission, depending on program tier and performance. <strong>Your own commission rate is shown in your partner portal at <a href="https://app.sonurastudio.com/partner" target="_blank" rel="noopener">app.sonurastudio.com/partner</a>.</strong></p>

        <h3>3.2 Founder Ambassador cohort</h3>
        <p>Anyone who joins before October 15, 2026 qualifies for 50% commission for the life of each referred customer's subscription.</p>

        <h3>3.3 What counts as a conversion</h3>
        <p>A paid subscription started by a new customer within 30 days of clicking your unique partner link, tracked via cookie attribution.</p>

        <h3>3.4 Referred customer discount</h3>
        <p>Customers you refer get 20% off their first 3 months.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section" id="payment">
        <h2>4. Payment</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Commissions are paid monthly via PayPal, within 30 days of the end of the month in which they were earned.</li>
          <li>The minimum payout threshold is £25. Amounts below this roll over to the following month.</li>
          <li>Refunded or charged-back subscriptions are deducted from future commission payments.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Restrictions</h2>

        <h3>5.1 Self-referral</h3>
        <p>You may not use your own partner link to purchase Sonura for yourself.</p>

        <h3>5.2 Paid search</h3>
        <p>You may run paid traffic to promote Sonura, but you may not bid on "Sonura" or close misspellings/variants in paid search campaigns.</p>

        <h3>5.3 No stacking</h3>
        <p>Partner commissions cannot be combined with any other Sonura discount, promo, or referral program.</p>

        <h3>5.4 Prohibited promotion</h3>
        <p>No spam, deceptive claims, or impersonation of Sonura.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Program Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update commission rates or these terms at any time. Continued participation after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Termination</h2>
        <p>Either party may end participation at any time. Commissions earned before termination will still be paid out on schedule; no new commissions accrue after termination.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about the program go to:</p>
        <p><a href="mailto:kindred@sonurastudio.com">kindred@sonurastudio.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: clamp(96px, 14vh, 180px) var(--page-pad) 80px;
    text-align: left;
    position: relative;
  }

  .legal-hero-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6.5vw, 88px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .legal-subhead {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    padding: 0 var(--page-pad) 120px;
  }

  .legal-content-inner { /* centered prose column */
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .legal-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .legal-section h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin: 32px 0 16px;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .legal-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    padding-left: 24px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .legal-section li {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-section li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 7px;
  }

  .legal-section a:hover {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .legal-section strong {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 96px var(--page-pad) 60px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      padding: 0 var(--page-pad) 80px;
    }

    .legal-section {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
